x:hover:no-underline x:decoration-from-font x:[text-underline-position:from-font] !text-anoma\",\"children\":\"Swaps\"}],\" apply it with a firm RFQ quote. The guaranteed minimum buy amount is committed as the wrap amount, and the venue’s exact fill satisfies it precisely.\"]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2d\",null,{\"href\":\"/earn\",\"prefetch\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:text-primary-600 x:underline x:hover:no-underline x:decoration-from-font x:[text-underline-position:from-font] !text-anoma\",\"children\":\"Earn\"}],\" applies the same pattern to ERC-4626 vaults, where the outcome is \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"predictable\"}],\" rather than fixed: a vault’s share price keeps moving while the transaction is proven. The wrap amount is therefore committed slightly below the quoted output, a worked example of the residual-balance property above.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"53:[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":\"BNB Smart Chain\",\"className\":\"x:m-0 x:border x:border-gray-300 x:px-4 x:py-2 x:dark:border-gray-600\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://bscscan.com/address/0xee4b283fA62AE445DcfDf9a34a7569a8Bc6Ba7D5\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noreferrer\",\"className\":\"x:focus-visible:nextra-focus x:text-primary-600 x:underline x:hover:no-underline x:decoration-from-font x:[text-underline-position:from-font] !text-anoma\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"nextra-code\",\"dir\":\"ltr\",\"children\":\"0xee4b283fA62AE445DcfDf9a34a7569a8Bc6Ba7D5\"}],false]}],\"className\":\"x:m-0 x:border x:border-gray-300 x:px-4 x:py-2 x:dark:border-gray-600\"}]],\"className\":\"x:m-0 x:border-t x:border-gray-300 x:p-0 x:dark:border-gray-600 x:even:bg-gray-100 x:even:dark:bg-gray-600/20\"}]\n"])</script><script>self